cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the data or the code of VN2, please cite the competition."
type: dataset
title: "VN2 Inventory Planning Challenge"
abstract: >-
  Weekly sales and in-stock flags of 599 store-product combinations (297 products in 67 stores of an
  anonymous retailer), from April 2021 to June 2024, from the VN2 inventory competition of 2025.
  With the official simulator, the benchmark and the starting inventory.
